<description>&lt;p&gt;A school roof collapsed in Peshawar, killing dozens of children and a teacher, with at least 30 children reported dead, according to The New York Times. The Taliban and Russia are drawing closer, increasing regional tension as Pakistan imposes emergency rule in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. In Afghanistan, an emergency border response is underway, as detailed in the ReliefWeb report covering 27 September to 10 October 2026. The conflict in the region produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/15/at-least-4-including-3-children-killed-in-us-elementary-school-shooting?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm89zp48k4kzo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/16/four-killed-in-oregon-elementary-school-shooting-including-three-children-aged-5-to-11&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNN0RUVDEwSW03NVo4Tlo0bkNwYl9mR1BrVU5aR3FCWjhqSGlJY0h3TUxYTWd6MzZZTWxlT0xnQTNUVXdUSG5ldmJ3X2xXQklhTUdSMFFCdEI5eVJZYXRmQUlSNTlab3B5VVpkT1pqQnRwbUM0d2I4QkFxZThQdHVydG41THo4ci0zc0Jqc05xQUlQNDJBQVVrdWQzTnliRjA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/16/peshawar-mourns-children-killed-in-school-roof-collapse?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cwe8r29mjd05o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNWGUwYjd4QmwtUjYycHVTOERLeGFycG9wbmpaNXZoNjlYTkxkOVNRa3lEMUxqQTAtSFNNaW1wRTZGSUFKZWRITW1RMkhZX1B1UG5MNE9kTkpYemVYd0gtRS1fbTZmdmFGdU1DWFJRQW55eFdRcHc